It's okay.

292
00:19:42,720 --> 00:19:43,720
It's all in the past.

293
00:19:51,480 --> 00:19:52,279
Luoluo,

294
00:19:52,680 --> 00:19:53,599
tell me,

295
00:19:53,759 --> 00:19:57,599
do you think Shen Zhou went to the hospital to pick me up?

296
00:19:58,799 --> 00:19:59,799
Careful, Grandma.

297
00:20:08,720 --> 00:20:09,400
Here.

298
00:20:09,400 --> 00:20:09,920
Here, sit down.

299
00:20:13,720 --> 00:20:14,839
Not seeing him,

300
00:20:15,400 --> 00:20:16,720
I feel uneasy.

301
00:20:17,759 --> 00:20:20,240
Where did he go?

302
00:20:23,720 --> 00:20:24,519
What's wrong?

303
00:20:25,039 --> 00:20:26,079
Tell me!

304
00:20:27,319 --> 00:20:28,119
Grandma,

305
00:20:29,279 --> 00:20:30,400
there's something...

306
00:20:31,599 --> 00:20:33,599
I'm afraid you won't be able to handle it if I tell you.

307
00:20:34,640 --> 00:20:35,920
Don't worry.

308
00:20:36,079 --> 00:20:37,519
As long as Gufeng is still here,

309
00:20:37,559 --> 00:20:39,440
as long as I, Fang Liangxi, am still here,

310
00:20:40,039 --> 00:20:41,200
even if the sky falls,

311
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:42,400
I can hold it up.

312
00:20:42,519 --> 00:20:43,200
Speak.

313
00:20:44,880 --> 00:20:46,359
Then you must stay calm.

314
00:20:48,960 --> 00:20:50,039
Coach Shen...

315
00:20:52,039 --> 00:20:53,039
he left.

316
00:20:54,559 --> 00:20:55,680
Where did he go?

317
00:21:02,640 --> 00:21:03,440
Darling,

318
00:21:04,519 --> 00:21:05,480
I'm leaving.

319
00:21:06,920 --> 00:21:07,640
The baby is gone.

320
00:21:07,640 --> 00:21:08,559
I'm heartbroken.

321
00:21:10,680 --> 00:21:12,119
The thought of being with you,

322
00:21:13,039 --> 00:21:15,000
and having to live with the murderer of our child

323
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:16,279
day and night...

324
00:21:17,240 --> 00:21:19,079
It hurts so much I can't breathe.

325
00:21:19,240 --> 00:21:21,359
I won't force you to do anything to Cheng Yan.

326
00:21:21,359 --> 00:21:22,839
After all, you are mother and son,

327
00:21:22,839 --> 00:21:24,200
bound by blood and bone.

328
00:21:24,559 --> 00:21:25,960
So as not to put you in a difficult position,

329
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:28,039
and to prove to those schemers

330
00:21:28,039 --> 00:21:30,400
that I'm not the gold digger they call me,

331
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:32,359
so I... I choose to leave.

332
00:21:33,599 --> 00:21:34,400
Darling,

333
00:21:34,599 --> 00:21:35,880
take good care of yourself.

334
00:21:37,400 --> 00:21:39,400
Let me call your name one last time.

335
00:21:39,960 --> 00:21:40,759
A Xi.

336
00:21:41,839 --> 00:21:43,359
We part ways,

337
00:21:44,799 --> 00:21:45,839
each to our own happiness.

338
00:21:48,359 --> 00:21:49,160
It's okay, Grandma.

339
00:21:54,279 --> 00:21:54,839
Mom,

340
00:21:55,599 --> 00:21:56,720
why are you crying so hard?

341
00:21:56,720 --> 00:21:57,480
Second Uncle is here, Grandma.

342
00:21:57,480 --> 00:21:57,920
Caught feelings?

343
00:22:00,480 --> 00:22:01,839
I told you a long time ago,

344
00:22:01,839 --> 00:22:03,279
no man is any good.

345
00:22:03,720 --> 00:22:05,559
His vows are just bullshit.

346
00:22:05,559 --> 00:22:06,880
Unless he's dead,

347
00:22:06,880 --> 00:22:08,799
he won't behave until he's hanging on the wall like my dad.

348
00:22:09,279 --> 00:22:10,079
Don't worry,

349
00:22:10,079 --> 00:22:12,519
I'll introduce you to some handsome guys later.

350
00:22:12,640 --> 00:22:13,440
Get out.

351
00:22:14,240 --> 00:22:15,559
Get the hell out!

352
00:22:15,960 --> 00:22:17,519
Get the hell out of the Cheng family!

353
00:22:18,240 --> 00:22:20,400
Never step foot in the Cheng house again!

354
00:22:20,400 --> 00:22:21,640
Unless I'm dead!

355
00:22:22,079 --> 00:22:22,880
Mom,

356
00:22:22,920 --> 00:22:24,400
I'm still your son.

357
00:22:32,559 --> 00:22:33,720
It's okay, it's okay, Grandma.

358
00:23:20,960 --> 00:23:22,279
What put you in the mood today

359
00:23:22,279 --> 00:23:23,599
to invite me for a wine tasting?

360
00:23:25,160 --> 00:23:26,920
Second Uncle has been sent abroad.

361
00:23:27,640 --> 00:23:29,920
This glass is a farewell toast to him.

362
00:23:32,000 --> 00:23:33,039
Here, have a taste.

363
00:23:33,039 --> 00:23:34,079
How is it?

364
00:23:54,440 --> 00:23:56,599
This has blackcurrant in it,

365
00:23:56,640 --> 00:23:57,440
and black cherry.

366
00:23:58,799 --> 00:24:01,119
It has a decadent fruity aroma.

367
00:24:04,440 --> 00:24:05,920
The name of this wine

368
00:24:07,200 --> 00:24:07,799
is

369
00:24:07,799 --> 00:24:08,680
Lust.

370
00:24:09,680 --> 00:24:10,480
What do you think?

371
00:24:11,759 --> 00:24:14,200
Isn't it a perfect send-off for Second Uncle?

372
00:24:35,079 --> 00:24:37,759
This house is really getting emptier by the day.

373
00:24:51,200 --> 00:24:52,599
The DNA test results are out.

374
00:24:52,640 --> 00:24:55,079
You and old Mrs. Cheng don't share a biological relationship.

375
00:25:02,640 --> 00:25:05,640
Come, try our new product.

376
00:25:06,000 --> 00:25:06,960
Lime Fruit Wine.

377
00:25:08,799 --> 00:25:10,720
I added dried plums to it.

378
00:25:10,720 --> 00:25:11,079
Director Sang.

379
00:25:11,079 --> 00:25:11,599
And cardamom.

380
00:25:11,839 --> 00:25:12,240
Thank you.

381
00:25:12,240 --> 00:25:12,759
So,

382
00:25:12,759 --> 00:25:13,480
it has a distinct taste.

383
00:25:13,480 --> 00:25:15,039
Director Lin made a very bold attempt!

384
00:25:15,400 --> 00:25:17,200
Good work, everyone.

385
00:25:18,599 --> 00:25:19,599
Everyone, have a taste.

386
00:25:21,599 --> 00:25:22,720
Have some more, you two.

387
00:25:27,599 --> 00:25:28,359
Long time no see,

388
00:25:28,599 --> 00:25:29,319
Sang Luo.

389
00:25:29,720 --> 00:25:31,039
What do you think of my wine?

390
00:25:31,640 --> 00:25:33,000
It's indeed a good wine.

391
00:25:33,279 --> 00:25:36,079
But the cardamom flavor is a bit weak.

392
00:25:36,599 --> 00:25:38,000
If it were a bit stronger,

393
00:25:38,079 --> 00:25:39,200
it might be even better.

394
00:25:40,240 --> 00:25:41,319
Thanks for your suggestion.

395
00:25:41,680 --> 00:25:43,759
But this is my style.

396
00:25:44,559 --> 00:25:45,200
Have some more.

397
00:25:49,119 --> 00:25:49,640
Here.

398
00:25:54,079 --> 00:25:54,759
It's so delicious.

399
00:25:54,839 --> 00:25:55,640
Really not bad.

400
00:25:58,359 --> 00:25:59,160
Exceptional.

401
00:26:03,680 --> 00:26:05,079
The grapes used are good.

402
00:26:11,079 --> 00:26:12,599
What do you think of this wine?

403
00:26:13,720 --> 00:26:16,039
I originally thought she had run out of ideas,

404
00:26:16,799 --> 00:26:17,960
but I didn't expect

405
00:26:17,960 --> 00:26:19,920
she could still develop a new product like this.

406
00:26:21,240 --> 00:26:22,039
However,

407
00:26:26,079 --> 00:26:27,799
I feel like something is off about it.

408
00:26:28,400 --> 00:26:29,839
You also think there's a problem with this wine?

409
00:26:33,880 --> 00:26:34,680
Cardamom?

410
00:26:37,079 --> 00:26:37,880
Cardamom.

411
00:26:40,319 --> 00:26:41,640
Lemons from Anyue,

412
00:26:41,839 --> 00:26:43,240
limes from Navarre,

413
00:26:43,240 --> 00:26:44,599
apples from Yantai,

414
00:26:44,599 --> 00:26:46,000
dried plums from Xinxing,

415
00:26:46,119 --> 00:26:48,079
and cardamom from Indonesia.

416
00:26:48,319 --> 00:26:51,160
These are the ingredients used in Director Lin's new wine.

417
00:26:51,960 --> 00:26:52,880
Are you sure?

418
00:26:53,000 --> 00:26:53,799
I'm sure.

419
00:26:53,920 --> 00:26:55,799
I prepared these ingredients myself.

420
00:26:56,000 --> 00:26:57,359
But as far as I know,

421
00:26:57,599 --> 00:26:59,279
the company hasn't purchased

422
00:26:59,279 --> 00:27:00,480
any Indonesian cardamom recently.

423
00:27:05,599 --> 00:27:07,839
Since you and Director Sang disagree,

424
00:27:08,680 --> 00:27:10,440
let's head to the processing workshop

425
00:27:11,079 --> 00:27:12,279
and extract some leftover materials.

426
00:27:12,720 --> 00:27:13,400
Let's see

427
00:27:14,240 --> 00:27:15,720
what exactly went wrong

428
00:27:15,720 --> 00:27:17,039
with the ingredients of that batch of Lime Fruit Wine.

429
00:27:19,680 --> 00:27:20,480
Mr. An.

430
00:27:21,559 --> 00:27:22,839
When brewing this wine,

431
00:27:23,160 --> 00:27:24,880
the Indonesian cardamom was already used up.

432
00:27:25,119 --> 00:27:26,559
To avoid affecting the production schedule,

433
00:27:26,839 --> 00:27:29,000
I replaced it with domestic cardamom that tastes similar.

434
00:27:30,559 --> 00:27:31,680
Does Director Lin know?

435
00:27:31,799 --> 00:27:33,440
I was afraid Director Lin would blame me for neglecting my duty,

436
00:27:33,440 --> 00:27:34,160
so...

437
00:27:34,440 --> 00:27:35,000
It's okay.

438
00:27:35,000 --> 00:27:36,000
You may leave now.

439
00:27:46,279 --> 00:27:48,319
Domestic cardamom has a rich flavor.

440
00:27:48,440 --> 00:27:49,400
It has floral notes,

441
00:27:49,400 --> 00:27:50,119
fruity notes,

442
00:27:50,119 --> 00:27:51,359
and a woody aftertaste.

443
00:27:51,519 --> 00:27:53,880
Indonesian cardamom is more intense and pungent.

444
00:27:54,839 --> 00:27:56,319
As a winemaker, Lin Wanmei

445
00:27:56,319 --> 00:27:57,880
can't even tell the difference between the two.

446
00:27:58,640 --> 00:27:59,440
Unless...

447
00:27:59,519 --> 00:28:01,079
the maker of this wine

448
00:28:02,680 --> 00:28:03,640
is someone else.
